{
    "info": {
        "_postman_id": "waffer-api-collection-v1",
        "name": "Waffer API — وفر",
        "description": "Complete API collection for Waffer financial management app.\n\n## Setup\n1. Import this collection into Postman\n2. Import the `Waffer.postman_environment.json` environment\n3. Select the environment in the top-right dropdown\n4. Run **Auth → Send OTP** then **Verify OTP** to get `auth_token`\n5. The token is auto-saved and used by all protected endpoints\n\n## Base URL\n`{{base_url}}` defaults to `http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1`\n\n## Authentication\nUses Laravel Sanctum bearer tokens. Tokens are obtained via OTP flow:\n- `POST /auth/send-otp` → `POST /auth/verify-otp` (returns token)\n\n## How OTP delivery works\nThe OTP is **always randomly generated** (no hardcoded codes).\n\nDelivery channels (in order of preference):\n1. **Push notification** to a raw FCM `device_token` passed in the request body (great for new users / web testers)\n2. **Push notification** to all registered active devices of an existing user\n3. **Log file** fallback (`storage/logs/laravel.log`) when no FCM token is available — for development only\n\n### Get an FCM token from your browser\nOpen `http://127.0.0.1:8000/fcm-tester.html` to grab a real FCM token from your browser, then paste it as `device_token` in the Send OTP request — the OTP will arrive as a push notification.",
        "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
    },
    "auth": {
        "type": "bearer",
        "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{auth_token}}", "type": "string" }]
    },
    "event": [
        {
            "listen": "prerequest",
            "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": ["pm.request.headers.add({ key: 'Accept', value: 'application/json' });", "pm.request.headers.add({ key: 'Accept-Language', value: pm.environment.get('locale') || 'ar' });"]
            }
        }
    ],
    "item": [
        {
            "name": "Auth",
            "item": [
                {
                    "name": "1. Send OTP (smart)",
                    "request": {
                        "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
                        "method": "POST",
                        "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                        "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/send-otp", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["auth", "send-otp"] },
                        "body": {
                            "mode": "raw",
                            "raw": "{\n    \"phone\": \"+966555555555\",\n    \"device_token\": \"\",\n    \"platform\": \"web\",\n    \"locale\": \"ar\"\n}"
                        },
                        "description": "**Endpoint ذكي**: يكتشف تلقائياً إن كان الرقم لمستخدم موجود (login) أو جديد (register).\n\n## Body\n```json\n{\n  \"phone\": \"+966555555555\",\n  \"device_token\": \"<FCM token>\",  // اختياري — يُستخدم لإرسال OTP كإشعار Push\n  \"platform\": \"web\",                // اختياري — android | ios | web\n  \"locale\": \"ar\"                    // اختياري — لغة الإشعار\n}\n```\n\n## كيف تحصل على FCM token للاختبار؟\nافتح `http://127.0.0.1:8000/fcm-tester.html` في المتصفح، اقبل إذن الإشعارات، انسخ الـ token، والصقه هنا.\n\n## Response\n```json\n{\n  \"data\": {\n    \"is_new_user\": false,\n    \"expires_in\": 120,\n    \"cooldown_seconds\": 60,\n    \"delivery\": \"push\",\n    \"hint\": \"الرمز تم إرساله كإشعار على جهازك\"\n  },\n  \"message\": \"تم إرسال رمز تسجيل الدخول\"\n}\n```\n\n## ملاحظات\n- **OTP عشوائي دائماً** — لا يوجد كود ثابت (حتى في local).\n- إذا لم تُرسل `device_token` ولم يكن للمستخدم أجهزة مسجلة → الكود يُكتب في `storage/logs/laravel.log` فقط (`delivery: log`).\n- الكود صالح **دقيقتين فقط**.\n- لا يمكن إعادة الإرسال قبل **60 ثانية**."
                    }
                },
                {
                    "name": "2. Verify OTP (smart)",
                    "event": [
                        {
                            "listen": "test",
                            "script": {
                                "type": "text/javascript",
                                "exec": [
                                    "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                                    "    const json = pm.response.json();",
                                    "    if (json.data && json.data.token) {",
                                    "        pm.environment.set('auth_token', json.data.token);",
                                    "        pm.environment.set('user_id', json.data.user.id);",
                                    "        console.log('✓ Logged in (existing user)');",
                                    "    } else if (json.data && json.data.is_new_user) {",
                                    "        console.log('ℹ Code verified — call /auth/register next');",
                                    "    }",
                                    "}"
                                ]
                            }
                        }
                    ],
                    "request": {
                        "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
                        "method": "POST",
                        "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                        "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/verify-otp", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["auth", "verify-otp"] },
                        "body": {
                            "mode": "raw",
                            "raw": "{\n    \"phone\": \"+966555555555\",\n    \"code\": \"123456\"\n}"
                        },
                        "description": "**Endpoint ذكي للتحقق**.\n\n## السلوك\n- إذا الرقم لمستخدم **موجود** → يُسجِّل دخوله ويُصدر `token`، يستهلك OTP.\n- إذا الرقم **جديد** → يُرجع `verified: true, is_new_user: true` بدون استهلاك الكود (لكي يُستخدم في `/auth/register`).\n\n## Response (موجود)\n```json\n{\n  \"data\": {\n    \"user\": { ... },\n    \"token\": \"1|abcdef...\",\n    \"is_new_user\": false\n  },\n  \"message\": \"تم تسجيل الدخول بنجاح\"\n}\n```\n\n## Response (جديد)\n```json\n{\n  \"data\": {\n    \"verified\": true,\n    \"is_new_user\": true\n  },\n  \"message\": \"تم التحقق، أكمل بيانات التسجيل\"\n}\n```"
                    }
                },
                {
                    "name": "3. Register (only if is_new_user)",
                    "event": [
                        {
                            "listen": "test",
                            "script": {
                                "type": "text/javascript",
                                "exec": ["if (pm.response.code === 201) {", "    const json = pm.response.json();", "    if (json.data && json.data.token) {", "        pm.environment.set('auth_token', json.data.token);", "        pm.environment.set('user_id', json.data.user.id);", "        console.log('✓ Registered & logged in');", "    }", "}"]
                            }
                        }
                    ],
                    "request": {
                        "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
                        "method": "POST",
                        "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                        "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/register", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["auth", "register"] },
                        "body": {
                            "mode": "raw",
                            "raw": "{\n    \"name\": \"Ahmed Test\",\n    \"phone\": \"+966555555555\",\n    \"code\": \"123456\",\n    \"email\": \"ahmed@test.com\",\n    \"monthly_income\": 8500,\n    \"currency\": \"SAR\",\n    \"language\": \"ar\"\n}"
                        },
                        "description": "إكمال تسجيل المستخدم الجديد بعد ما `verify-otp` رجّعت `is_new_user: true`.\n\nيُستخدم نفس الـ `code` الذي تحقق منه الـ verify-otp (الكود لم يُستهلك في الخطوة السابقة).\n\nالتسلسل الكامل لمستخدم جديد:\n```\n1. POST /auth/send-otp     { phone }\n2. POST /auth/verify-otp   { phone, code }   → is_new_user: true\n3. POST /auth/register     { phone, code, name, ... }\n```"
                    }
                },
                {
                    "name": "Firebase Login (ID Token)",
                    "event": [
                        {
                            "listen": "test",
                            "script": {
                                "type": "text/javascript",
                                "exec": [
                                    "if ([200, 201].includes(pm.response.code)) {",
                                    "    const json = pm.response.json();",
                                    "    if (json.data && json.data.token) {",
                                    "        pm.environment.set('auth_token', json.data.token);",
                                    "        pm.environment.set('user_id', json.data.user.id);",
                                    "        console.log('✓ Firebase login OK — is_new_user=' + json.data.is_new_user);",
                                    "    }",
                                    "}"
                                ]
                            }
                        }
                    ],
                    "request": {
                        "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
                        "method": "POST",
                        "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                        "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/firebase", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["auth", "firebase"] },
                        "body": {
                            "mode": "raw",
                            "raw": "{\n    \"id_token\": \"PASTE_FIREBASE_ID_TOKEN_HERE\",\n    \"name\": \"Ahmed\",\n    \"currency\": \"SAR\",\n    \"language\": \"ar\"\n}"
                        },
                        "description": "**تسجيل الدخول/التسجيل عبر Firebase Phone Auth** (الطريقة الموصى بها للإنتاج).\n\n## كيف تحصل على `id_token`؟\n\nمن تطبيق Flutter:\n```dart\nawait FirebaseAuth.instance.verifyPhoneNumber(\n  phoneNumber: '+966555555555',\n  verificationCompleted: (cred) {},\n  codeSent: (verificationId, _) async {\n    // المستخدم يدخل الـ OTP\n    final cred = PhoneAuthProvider.credential(\n      verificationId: verificationId,\n      smsCode: enteredCode,\n    );\n    final userCred = await FirebaseAuth.instance\n        .signInWithCredential(cred);\n    final idToken = await userCred.user!.getIdToken();\n    // أرسل idToken للسيرفر\n  },\n  verificationFailed: (e) {},\n  codeAutoRetrievalTimeout: (_) {},\n);\n```\n\n## السلوك\n- إذا الرقم/الإيميل مسجَّل: يُسجِّل دخوله ويُصدر Sanctum token.\n- إذا غير مسجَّل: يُنشئ حساب جديد تلقائياً ويعيد `is_new_user: true`.\n\n## الحقول الاختيارية\n- `name`, `monthly_income`, `currency`, `language` — تُستخدم فقط عند التسجيل لأول مرة."
                    }
